<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Malbak, Lenco talks terminated.</title>
<headline>Malbak, Lenco talks terminated.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malbak Ltd on Tuesday advised shareholders that discussions which were taking place between Malbak and Lenco Holdings Ltd, which may have an effect on the Malbak share price have been terminated.</p>
<p>The announcement was made further to the cautionary announcements on June 5 and June 26.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
